// Title: Disable Macro Runtime Scan Scope
// ID: ab871450-37dc-4a3a-997f-6662aa8ae0f1
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-10-25
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment
// Description: Detects tampering with the MacroRuntimeScanScope registry key to disable runtime scanning of enabled macros
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

registry where ((registry.path like "*_\\SOFTWARE\\*" and registry.path like "*_\\Microsoft\\Office\\*" and registry.path like "*_\\Common\\Security*") and registry.path endswith "\\MacroRuntimeScanScope" and registry.data.strings == "DWORD (0x00000000)")
